        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "\"While that Rama was going on exile, Lakshmana, endowed with humbleness, and augmentor of his mother Sumitra's joy, and a loving and a dear brother to Rama, followed him out of affection, showing brotherly fraternity.[1-1-25, 26a]"
      }
